inal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L8txP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e71d174b-99e1-47df-9048-5d69835cb12d","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"フリーランスでガッツリ稼げるってーとチームになる人材召喚できるとか","ts":"1621936877.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W5DlV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e552270f-8b95-4b46-a613-dc12f2bfc100","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"マネジメントしたくないので会社員万歳","ts":"1621936808.072500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F1p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8792058b-66d2-42fe-b26d-81ba8cc95fc0","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"フリーランスできるほどつよつよでも営業力も無いし、まして怠惰なので、\n会社に所属してお仕事降ってくる環境は有り難し","ts":"1621936770.072400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y5I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa456842-0d86-45c0-87a8-5808f1244121","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"フリーランスだとなかなか金になる実績積める仕事回ってこない","ts":"1621936770.072300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ASy="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c27cca50-21f3-4e17-a5d8-645d23e98fb5","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"近年みたいにヤベー人材不足じゃなきゃ詳細設計やらせてもらえたかわからんからなぁorz","ts":"1621936717.070800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mViP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8adfea0-55f7-4ea8-a64a-dba5eaabf26a","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"おっしゃるとおりなんで一度どこかの会社に入れて一通りできるところなら\nいきなりフリーランスやらずに経験積んだほうが幸せになれます。","ts":"1621936640.069700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+9QBo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00019058-e8fb-42c4-856f-03857ee9f638","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こういう記事(というか有料記事全般)、自分のライフワークには必要ないと切り捨てているがトータルで損してるのか得してるのかわからんな","ts":"1621934466.068100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X02U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e2fb92c-59ec-40d4-8c45-7cca46c91319","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"この業界人足りなくなってるから、少子化もあるし年をとったことで仕事がなくなるとなるかな","ts":"1621934260.068000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QCw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c92dfcc2-bb0b-4f4d-9081-c9183650953c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"50歳定年説、うちのボスが反例なので信じられないな…\nきついきつい言いながら私より体力あるのでｗ","ts":"1621928485.067300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fNwUQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c70f2da1-82b8-4701-965d-aa713e8dad3f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"\u0026gt; 老化と加齢は別もの。老化は病気\nらしい","ts":"1621928163.065900","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1621928179.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eqH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"566e1b15-d717-4b42-9cdf-2a6297bd819c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"これとか気になったけど有料なんすよね・・・（コメントから類推するしかない）\nNewsPicks１つ買い切りだと読みたいの結構あるんだけどな\n\u003chttps://newspicks.com/news/5852131\u003e","ts":"1621928133.065400","attachments":[{"fallback":"NewsPicks: 【完全解説】ゼロから学ぶ、不老長寿の最先端","id":1,"title":"【完全解説】ゼロから学ぶ、不老長寿の最先端","title_link":"https://newspicks.com/news/5852131","text":"NewsPicks でコメントを読む","image_url":"https://contents.newspicks.com/images/news/5852131/share","blocks":null,"ts":1621197000,"service_name":"NewsPicks","service_icon":"https://newspicks.com/np_logo.png","from_url":"https://newspicks.com/news/5852131","original_url":"https://newspicks.com/news/5852131"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IZXX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e27a16e8-164b-48d2-9d8c-4be52132260d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"BI で働かなくてもいい世界はよ","ts":"1621928062.064400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"28ng"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fea285ac-0f1b-42c8-b2c6-0866075bb8b6","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"個人差はかなりあるでしょうけど、40代後半辺りから色々な面で厳しくなってくる感じですねぇ\n最前線と言わずとも前線側で働き続けるならけっこうなモチベが必要だと思いますわ","ts":"1621927995.064100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QmP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35e2a881-5e4b-4541-869c-64f2dc48e33a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"でもまあ50歳結構きつい面ありますよね。。。人間50から急激に老ける（脳的にも体力的にも精神的にも）印象にありますね。はやく老化を止める薬欲しい・・・","ts":"1621927870.062400","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1621927903.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HH=T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3db51d2-877c-44c1-8bd0-49477d708391","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"まさに仰る通りで、自分がその年齢層になって市場がどうなってるか次第ですね。\n不透明な部分なのでそこはリスクと言えばリスク。","ts":"1621927820.061700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WmcyT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8AE0F561-15C5-4C3C-8AAE-3CC3CC6246BB","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"まぁ、35歳定年説も過去のものになってきたので、それも今後変わっていくかもしれないですね","ts":"1621927752.060000","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1621927763.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["U01J7703PFT","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"41Aq7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85d1f766-c8e7-4b56-9404-8a623b2a8a42","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"ちなみにフリーランスの場合、50歳以上辺りから募集の年齢制限に引っかかる確率かなり上がると思うので\n高齢になってからの身の振り方が難しそうっていうのも明確なデメリットとしてあると思います","ts":"1621927653.058100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uKGw2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8273a78c-760b-4739-97b1-65c2442e3e60","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"新しい技術全く無いのも飽きるので\n新しい技術取り込む→その技術にしばらくのめり込む→飽きた頃にまた別の技術に・・・\nとかなれば個人的には好み。まあそう上手くはいかんのですが。","ts":"1621927516.057400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7r3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3642943-902f-4bc2-90ee-60e42804120b","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"この構造は毎年利益を伸ばし続けないといけない企業体に科せられた罪なのだろうか","ts":"1621927492.056800","thread_ts":"1621927358.054000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mGHqL"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"fdb52956-a1d6-4f3f-aacf-019e7e8647b9","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"便利になればなるほど仕事は増える\nのくせ時間は変わらないという","ts":"1621927358.054000","thread_ts":"1621927358.054000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zAL6j"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"7ffbf309-bc0f-4a30-b4c8-afa58a74583c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ときどき技術革新とは一体・・・って思いますね。クソみたいな仕事、つまらない仕事をやらなくていいのはいいですけど、クリエイティブかつ新しいのばっかりも結構疲れるという・・・","ts":"1621927428.056000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PnF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20b811be-08b1-42ef-ad5b-5c09af5ab199","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"便利になって時間空いたらそこに別の仕事が流れ込むだけなので、トータルで見ると別に楽にならないというやつ","ts":"1621927362.054300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vmjvp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdb52956-a1d6-4f3f-aacf-019e7e8647b9","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"便利になればなるほど仕事は増える\nのくせ時間は変わらないという","ts":"1621927358.054000","thread_ts":"1621927358.054000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zAL6j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"984a4714-f110-4adf-8e33-1b61a5c57df7","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"仕事の範囲が増えていってるんですよね。。。便利に（楽に）なっていくと範囲が広くなって結局仕事減らないかむしろ逆に難しくなっていくという・・・","ts":"1621927319.053100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tMa6c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08d0514d-fb36-432b-9a5b-2f98879f7e41","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"できるエンジニアになりたい","ts":"1621927257.052200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ehx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf5f6b08-5b79-4c24-bccb-acf3fda627a8","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"『いい仕事』の定義がたぶん人によって違うと思うので、けっこう難しいポイントだと思うんですけどね","ts":"1621927246.052000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yRa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9D0C33CD-C2C9-4357-9F2A-4CD6B1BBC18B","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"こと開発に関しては難しくなる一方なので、ノーコード爆撃が成功しないかぎり、できる開発者の仕事がなくなることはないですね。","ts":"1621927138.049700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":7,"users":["U01J7703PFT","U7B4ZD49X","U01U44T1FK2","U9S4G0LJW","U022HK3B58V","U7JL1UKKL","U013QL1RAPN"]},{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wG3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcba4b23-8a0d-495e-a8c8-859f18dfb6d5","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"重要性の高いポジションになるのは、確かにフリーランスだと難しいとは思いますね。\n仰る通りの傾向はあると思います。","ts":"1621927087.048100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i7eK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0be89b7a-b0c8-4fdf-9dcc-73c7d92bc897","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"個人的にはいい仕事にどんだけ出会えるのかがちょっと疑問なんですよね。うちでもフリーランスの人何人か手伝ってもらってますけど、やっぱりいい仕事・おもしろい仕事は社員でやりたいんですよね。社内に技術を残すとか技術力向上という意味においても","ts":"1621926907.046900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U8R597E9H","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KySN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2a7c923-11f9-4f6f-b60b-f0e877ac8507","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"フリーランスは景気による影響受けやすいところが明確なデメリットですかね\nただ、ここ最近だとまともに仕事が出来るエンジニアの人材不足っぷりが激しいので\nよっぽど選り好みしない限り仕事が途切れることはあんまり無い感じです\n不景気になったら知らない。","ts":"1621926778.045200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HCZbO"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023EHYJU5N","text":"\u003c@U023EHYJU5N\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621888703.043000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"1d2f99dc-4ba6-4b02-a5bb-2bb6a4f9520a","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"そんなこと言われたらメンタルゴミカスなので言われた日から寝込みそう...","ts":"1621944305.077100","thread_ts":"1621943734.076800","parent_user_id":"U782D5DF1","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhF+j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c942651e-975d-4f9d-956b-683e7a44b625","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"もしご縁あって依頼あった日には\n田舎に帰りますわって言って\n金払ってでも案件蹴るつもりなんだけどまだないですね","ts":"1621945327.077500","thread_ts":"1621943734.076800","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1621945350.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U782D5DF1","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KeJ+/"}]}]
